{"ts":"2026-07-24T21:02:44.626Z","author":"codex-root","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## Production evidence\\n\\nThe exact tagged release run completed all tests and 100 percent coverage, then failed in security step 8 because rg and trivy were absent. The auto-release preparation workflow already provisions ripgrep, ShellCheck, and pinned Trivy; publish.yml must share that prerequisite contract."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"hac-zwvk"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Tag publication runner omits mandatory release verification tools"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"The v2026.7.23 tag-driven Release workflow reaches bun run release:verify on a clean runner without provisioning ripgrep or Trivy, so the mandatory gate exits 127 before changelog, package smoke, publication, or release creation."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":0},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["github-actions","production-follow-up","publish","release","security","trivy"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-24T21:02:44.626Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-24T21:02:44.626Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/deadline","value":"2026-07-25T21:02:44.626Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/assignee","value":"codex-root"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"codex-root"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":90},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Tag-driven publish provisions ripgrep, ShellCheck, and pinned Trivy before release:verify; Workflow YAML, ShellCheck, local release verifier, and a hosted non-publishing rehearsal prove the complete clean-runner contract; Open GitHub blocker 68 is closed only after successful exact-head hosted evidence"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/definition_of_ready","value":"Failed Release run 29982873926 and workflow source identify missing binaries, not a product test failure"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"lossless-automatic-releases"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"publication-runner-verifier-parity"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"Restore reliable provenance publication without weakening mandatory gates."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/impact","value":"Prevents tagged releases from being stranded after the release commit and tag are created."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/outcome","value":"Preparation and publication runners install the same verifier prerequisites."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"v2026.7.23 exists but its tag-driven release failed before publication, leaving GitHub issue 68 open."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"hac-r17v"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/reviewer","value":"unbraind"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":100},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/sprint","value":"2026-07-compact-registry"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/release","value":"2026.7.24"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/reporter","value":"codex-root"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/environment","value":"GitHub Actions Release workflow on clean ubuntu-latest runner"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/repro_steps","value":"Run publish.yml for v2026.7.23; Verify release quality gates reaches scripts/release/verify-release.sh and exits 127 when rg and trivy are invoked."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"The tag-driven runner provisions every mandatory verifier binary and proceeds to changelog/package/publication gates."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"All 1209 tests and 100 percent coverage pass, then release:verify fails because rg and trivy are not installed."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/affected_version","value":"2026.7.23"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/component","value":"release-automation"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/regression","value":false},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/customer_impact","value":"The package and GitHub release are not published even though the version commit and tag exist."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"hac-ak9g","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T21:02:44.626Z","author":"codex-root"},{"id":"hac-l25p","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T21:02:44.626Z","author":"codex-root"},{"id":"hac-m1kj","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T21:02:44.626Z","author":"codex-root"},{"id":"hac-s43s","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-07-24T21:02:44.626Z","author":"codex-root"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-24T21:02:44.626Z","author":"codex-root","text":"This is not a duplicate of hac-l25p: that issue repaired pm-changelog and verifier provisioning in auto-release.yml; this production failure is in the separate tag-driven publish.yml runner."}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-24T21:02:44.626Z","author":"codex-root","text":"Do not rerun publication until the workflow fix is merged; local and PR verification must remain non-publishing."}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/learnings","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-24T21:02:44.626Z","author":"codex-root","text":"A downstream tag workflow has an independent clean-runner environment; provisioning tools in the parent auto-release job does not carry into publish.yml."}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/files","value":[{"path":".github/workflows/publish.yml","scope":"project","note":"Missing release verifier prerequisites"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tests","value":[{"command":"bun run release:verify","scope":"project","timeout_seconds":2400,"note":"Mandatory aggregate gate remains strict"},{"command":"ruby -e \"require yaml; Dir.glob(%q(.github/workflows/*.yml)).each { |f| YAML.load_file(f) }\"","scope":"project","timeout_seconds":60,"note":"Workflow syntax parse"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/docs","value":[{"path":"docs/RELEASING.md","scope":"project","note":"Clean-runner publication contract"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"26b0224550dd794c37a3ae761115294bce38f8e52a95204e5954057382e72b54","message":"Create publish runner provisioning issue"}
